abstract: >-
  Locked-artifact measurement harness and research manuscript for a study of
  cross-mechanism authorization seams. Predictions, cases, arms, locks, and
  hashes are recorded in internal locks before each run; the manuscript reports
  only discrepancies that survived reconciliation. This is a research preprint,
  not a peer-reviewed result.
